      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "One of the Best Comedy Clubs in Vancouver is coming to Bowen Island!  Get ready to laugh until your sides hurt at the Bowen Theatre's Underground Comedy show - it's going to be a night to remember!A professional show with the cities best comedians dropping in to perfect their sets. Acts from Netflix"
