    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Wonder Women!     Celebrating the music and stories of female composers   “Why hurry over beautiful things? Why not linger and enjoy them?” So pondered Clara Schumann, remembered as one of the finest pianists of all time.  In “Wonder Women!”, pianist Sarah Hagen delves into the remarkable stories an"
