      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "PULP FICTION (18+)    Suit up for an evening of dark humor, tangled timelines, and unforgettable characters and dialogue with Tarantino's epic crime cult classic Pulp Fiction.   Costumes encouraged! This film is rated R and the event is 18+.   Doors and Concession Open: 5:30pm Film Starts: 6:00pm"
      }
